<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stocks tumble 2.37 pct before close.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stocks tumble 2.37 pct before close.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan share prices were sharply down near Thursday's close as frantic selling in the electronic sector defied an apparent government attempt to lift the index through buying in the heavily weighted financials.</p>
<p>Just minutes before closing, the weighted index was down 2.37 percent or 194.26 points to 7,987.36.</p>
